    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "F3A817A8F421466F",
      "text": "不过，即使时代变了，\\n与宝可梦相遇的那份感动\\r\\n也都不会褪色。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
